{
  "category": "Superpower Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Loves to build its muscles. It trains in all styles of martial arts to become even stronger.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Loves to build its muscles. It trains in all styles of martial arts to become even stronger.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very powerful in spite of its small size. Its mastery of many types of martial arts makes it very tough.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always brimming with power, it passes time by lifting boulders. Doing so makes it even stronger.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves to work out and build its muscles. It is never satisfied, even if it trains hard all day long.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It trains by lifting rocks in the mountains. It can even pick up a GRAVELER with ease.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "MACHOP’s muscles are special - they never get sore no matter how much they are used in exercise. This POKéMON has sufficient power to hurl a hundred adult humans.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "MACHOP exercises by hefting around a GRAVELER as if it were a barbell. There are some MACHOP that travel the world in a quest to master all kinds of martial arts.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It continually undertakes strenuous training to master all forms of martial arts. Its strength lets it easily hoist a sumo wrestler onto its shoulders.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its whole body is composed of muscles. Even though it’s the size of a human child, it can hurl 100 grown-ups.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Loves to build its muscles. It trains in all styles of martial arts to become even stronger.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hefts a GRAVELER repeatedly to strengthen its entire body. It uses every type of martial arts.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its muscles never cramp however much it trains. It lives in the mountains away from humans.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of GEODUDE at once.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always brimming with power, it passes time by lifting boulders. Doing so makes it even stronger.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves to work out and build its muscles. It is never satisfied, even if it trains hard all day long.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of Geodude at once.",
      "version": "black"
